  "unsupportedDiagnostics": {
    "route": "RUV2202",
    "runtimeFeature": "RUV2204"
  },
  "$conditionalSupportNote": [
    "`supports` above is what each adapter declares with no options — which is",
    "what the capability test constructs, and what a project gets by default.",
    "One capability is conditional:",
    "",
    "  cloudflare — `isr` and `ppr` require `isr.kvBinding`. A Worker has no",
    "  filesystem, so a revalidated document needs Workers KV. The capability",
    "  follows the option rather than being assumed: a Worker that re-renders",
    "  every request while reporting `x-ruvyxa-isr: HIT` is worse than a build",
    "  that stops with RUV2202."
  ]
